# Browser security headers for static assets (SEC-012, plan
# C:\dev\security\plans\2026-10-22-zone-hardening.md Part C).
# Worker-generated responses (/api/*, /lexi/act) get the same set from
# withSecurityHeaders() in src/worker.js.
# frame-ancestors 'self' rather than 'none' so same-site embeds keep working.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
